# 🚀 Customer Churn Prediction

<p align="center">
  <b>End-to-End Machine Learning Project to Predict Customer Churn</b><br>
  <i>Feature Engineering • Model Optimization • Business Insights</i>
</p>

---

## 📌 Overview
This project predicts whether a customer will leave a bank (**churn prediction**) using machine learning models.  
It combines **EDA, feature engineering, model comparison, and hyperparameter tuning** to build a high-performance solution.

---

## 🎯 Objective
✔ Predict customer churn (`Exited`)  
✔ Identify key churn drivers  
✔ Compare multiple ML models  
✔ Optimize performance using tuning  

---

## 🧾 Dataset Snapshot

| Feature | Description |
|--------|------------|
| CreditScore | Customer credit score |
| Age | Customer age |
| Tenure | Years with bank |
| Balance | Account balance |
| NumOfProducts | Products used |
| EstimatedSalary | Salary |
| Geography | Country |
| Gender | Male/Female |

🎯 **Target Variable:** `Exited`

---

